false,"text":"結婚4年目のトランジスタグラマーちゃん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも仲良しの超ラブラブ夫婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫婦ともに子供を望んでおり、夫婦生活も協力を怠らず頑張っているが、なかなかできず旦那の親からも最近いろいろ言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“子なきは去れ!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“離婚した方がいいんじゃないか。”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女のところまでは届かないが、旦那はかなりひどい事を言われているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旦那はひた隠しにして彼女をかばっているが、それが申し訳なく、なんとかしたくて子種ビジネスにすがる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16809","sourceWorkId":"25239","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚4年目のトランジスタグラマーちゃん。 いつも仲良しの超ラブラブ夫婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫婦生活を頑張っているがなかなか子供ができず、義父母から色々と言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その声が彼女に直接届くことはないが、旦那はかなり責められているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それをなんとかしたくて、子種ビジネスにすがってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56220"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"27 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16809","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16809","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16809","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16809","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16809","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13f67bde5e62fc68a8e49eac77fa54bf9b046b55ed04b7a96f65ea2164841178.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/640e2e367c4bba0c149d9fc83daa36fda00270a97485cd4170bdeaa37c45345f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"結城ほのか","creatorId":"vndb:s6018","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6018","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6018","name":"結城 ほのか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213718:56220:20256:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62604","characterName":"レイナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56222","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213718"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16811"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62604"},"originalCharacterName":"レイナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"95"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Works at a bathhouse (brothel). Whether it is her personalty or experience, she the ideal woman that is both friendly and beautiful, and seemingly understanding of her customers' needs."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is in love with one of her customers and wants to get married to them. Her boyfriend said if she got pregnant he would marry her and she would be able to leave the prostitution business. Promising him she wouldn't let anyone come inside her, she would claim the kid as his."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62604"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本番のない風俗ヘルス嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生時代に大恋愛の末捨てられた辛い経験から、一転風俗に身を落としているが、性格は明るく人懐っこく可愛らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もともと優しすぎる人柄であったのが、失恋以降、人を好きになる事に臆病になってしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな人間性が、風俗に身を置いていても表に出るので、彼女を本気で口説く客は大変多く、中には風俗を辞めて子供作って結婚しようと言ってくる客もいたりして、その客が今回の相談の種である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"毎回、禁止されているSEXを許してしまい、しかも避妊もせずに中出し三昧をさせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女自身もかなり本気なのだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むろん、サービス内容にSEXは含まれてはいないので、店にしれたらアウト!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その男とのみ極秘に本番をしているのだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当に子供が出来たら、彼の言うとおり結婚してもいかな……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"と考えているが、なかなか妊娠しないので主人公の子種サービスを利用することにした。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16811","sourceWorkId":"25239","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本番なしの風俗ヘルス嬢。 大恋愛の末に捨てられた経験から風俗に身を落とした。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は優しく明るく人懐っこいが、失恋以降は恋愛に臆病になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在本気で結婚を迫っている客がおり、まんざらでもなく毎回本番を許している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供ができたら結婚してもいいかなと思っているが、なかなか妊娠しないため……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56222"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"24 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16811","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16811","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"154 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16811","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16811","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16811","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8e05f47aa91c4c5f97532c9857d7635045746b5b5432b9e95a1f1c6c1707401.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7cd813f277867a2ea9d4a5656844f61a2cd70d9a97662ad86302dd6189370a5a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤邑鈴香","creatorId":"vndb:s2309","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2309","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2309","name":"藤邑鈴香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213718:56222:16173:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62605","characterName":"桃井 愛美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56221","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213718"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16810"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62605"},"originalCharacterName":"桃井 愛美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"101"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A woman who's been with her current boyfriend for half a year and is desperate for having a child. In reality she is a gold digger that dates multiple men, having them spoil her despite not asking for anything."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her plan is to get pregnant and blackmail her boyfriend into paying her off so he doesn't have to raise the child. Though she has no intention of keeping her pregnancy once she gets the money. Her boyfriend -- like Manami herself -- is a player that has multiple girlfriends. However, she doesn't let on for fear he would break up with her before her plan is complete. Neither of them really seem to like each other beyond their money/sex appeal."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62605"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"交際半年で、結婚を迫って子供を欲しがる女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロポーション抜群で、一見お嬢様っぽい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、実は金持ちイケメン御曹司に狙いをつけては、繰り返す結婚詐欺まがいの女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何処で狂ったのか、物欲、性欲、金銭欲に従順で金の為ならなんでもするような人生観を持ち、その豊満なボディでの色気作戦で数々の男を騙してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回も、妊娠をエサに金をゆすろうとするが、相手の御曹司はなかなかのプレイボーイで一筋縄では騙されてはくれない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すでに、金目当てと感づかれているらしく、遊び相手の一人という位置づけになっているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこで「妊娠してしまえば」と主人公の子種ビジネスを利用しようと企んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16810","sourceWorkId":"25239","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"交際半年で結婚を迫り、子供を欲しがっている女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様っぽい外見だが、実はイケメン御曹司を狙う結婚詐欺まがいの女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこで狂ったのか物欲・性欲・金銭欲に従順で、数々の男たちを騙してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回は金目当てと気付かれてしまい、一刻も早く妊娠したいと企んでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56221"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"29 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16810","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"101 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16810","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16810","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16810","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16810","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89333c393f8b925f9acfced938e4287cdb2e3a5ae5aeb7aae26356fcce6cc1cf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/078541d8c55cc4d43b8ef9494c905b42b28ca3e21e6a4e5369a6662f3be9b9a2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"月森ねね","creatorId":"vndb:s12563","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12563","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12563","name":"月森 ねね","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213718:56221:25284:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63210","characterName":"法条 夏子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56223","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213718"},{"characterId":"56223","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"249812"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16812"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63210"},"originalCharacterName":"法条 夏子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A married woman who is working at the protagonist's office. She usually harshly criticizes his modus operandi. She wants a child but her husband does not, so she hasn't had sex for a while."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Secretly fell in love the protagonist. Tooya has an inkling of Nastuko's feelings but never made a move because of fear of losing her -- his important employee. While she initially loved her husband, their relationship changed after marriage. Her husband kept trying to escalate their sexual acts but Natsuko refused. Since then, he became colder towards her and distanced himself from her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63210"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の事務所で働く人妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のビジネスである妊娠願望のある女性を調達してくる名人、敏腕スタッフである"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、会社の経営にもチョイチョイ口を出し、主人公のやり口を辛辣にののしる辛口コメントの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の家庭は上手く行っていると強がるが、実は子供が欲しいらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうやら旦那が子供拒否で、やりたいだけの男だったので、現在はセックスレスのようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"25239","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一ノ渡事務所で働く敏腕スタッフ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前作から２年、今年からは遠哉が連れてきた冴城と一緒に事務所を切り盛りすることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常時事務所を留守となり、あろうことか元カノの伊織のもとに駆け込んだ遠哉に苛立ちが隠せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在家庭の方はヤリたがりの夫とのレスが深刻化し、別居するにまで至っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その日々の苛立ちを迫ってくる冴城にもてはやされることで緩和しているが、実は冴城も面倒なことばかり起こす男だと知って最近は辟易。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結局はダメンズに振り回される人生のようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"26911","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の事務所で働く人妻。 妊娠願望のある女性を調達してくる名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同時に、会社の経営にも口出しして主人公のやり口を辛辣に罵る辛口の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の家庭は上手くいっていると強がるが、実は子供が欲しいらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旦那はヤりたいだけの子供拒否で、現在はセックスレスになっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56223"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/dedd44f63218acc2acae7fe9b0b789b4dda238fb05ae80a7e8216d2371aa2ea2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f619cf94d6df365ffc429c0ade0af708298c6300c4f7ea0627493b4e3fa0b2be.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"なつめ美南海","creatorId":"vndb:s5844","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5844","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5844","name":"なつめ 美南海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213718:56223:25459:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63211","characterName":"下古立 伊織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56224","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213718"},{"characterId":"56224","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"249812"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16813"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63211"},"originalCharacterName":"下古立 伊織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"32"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"95"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A married woman with children. A capable staff at the protagonist's rival company. She's actually the protagonist's former girlfriend. They were even engaged, but she left when he told her that he didn't want children."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She usually comes to Tooya's office to mess around and steal his clients. In truth, she's just trying to clear away her lingering affections and regrets."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63211"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グラマーなモデル体型で、主人公の子種ビジネスと同じ事をしているライバル会社の敏腕スタッフ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は主人公の元カノで、昔は結婚の約束をしていたが、主人公に子供が欲しくないと言われ、別れた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、度々主人公を足蹴にするが、まんざら未練がない訳ではないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は、別の男と所帯を持ち、子供までいる勝ち組のはずだが、何故かチョクチョク事務所にチャチャを入れに来る女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"依頼人を横取りするなど、主人公の仕事の妨害をし、個人的に昔の恨みをはらしているつもりらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16813","sourceWorkId":"25239","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一ノ渡事務所と同じく子種ビジネスを事業展開する女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前作から２年経った今も元カレの遠哉との縁は切れておらず、むしろ遠哉を自分の下で働かせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近はペニスの大小、種類別のイケメンなど様々な男性を揃えて、女性が相手を選べる会社作りに尽力。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16813","sourceWorkId":"26911","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のライバル会社の敏腕スタッフ。 子持ちの人妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は主人公の元カノで、婚約までしていたが子供が欲しくないと言われ別れた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく主人公の事務所に来ては茶々を入れたり、依頼を横取りしたりしているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は恨みを晴らしているつもりで未練たらたら。 足蹴にしてまんざらではない様子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56224"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16813","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16813","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16813","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16813","sourceWorkId":"25239","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a49742035ed96921f6a78b8cae4a69dd7e496bc030fe5a6b420e836d64613dd5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/7705ce05a5dc465da71a92af22c96b515de46d9830974d569e41ae6528d36521.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ありかわ真奈","creatorId":"vndb:s5761","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5761","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5761","name":"ありかわ真奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","ide